{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All Living Things</strong> is an animated art-book puzzle game inspired by <i>The Ripley Scroll</i>, a 15th-century alchemical manuscript. Solve 12 intricate visual puzzles, each reflecting a stage in the alchemical process. Select and sequence objects to create looping animations, guided by cryptic verse and symbolic imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>HAND CRAFTED STOP-MOTION ANIMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All Living Things </i>uses carefully made stop-motion animation for every in-game asset. As you solve puzzles you imbue images with charming animated vitality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/lion_00.gif?t=1747404236\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ALLEGORICAL IMAGES AND POETRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter puzzles inspired by real life alchemical emblems and historical visual language. Your journey will be aided by unique poems that inspire you to think lyrically and logically!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/GIF_16-05-2025_12-55-55.gif?t=1747404236\" /><strong>UNIQUE PUZZLE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All Living Things </i>introduces a unique visual puzzle mechanic that invites you to carefully observe mystical and natural processes in order to uncover the secrets behind cryptic hermetic emblems...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681340/extras/puzzleexample.gif?t=1747404236\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681340?t=1747404236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681340?t=1747404236","capsule_image":"h